This game is original work. It is not affiliated with, and contains no assets,
names, characters, maps, music or code from, any commercial game.

It reuses and adapts code from these QSOLKCB projects (Apache-2.0):
  - QUICKSCOPER: matrix/ray math, batched-box WebGL renderer, flow-field
    navigation, synthesized Web Audio structure, Xbox standard-mapping input,
    app lifecycle (pause, pointer lock, focus loss), offline service worker.
  - VANILLAJS: fixed-step accumulator (modules/time FixedClock) and the
    swept, constant-velocity projectile model (modules/projectiles); from
    v1.2.0, drift-repaying FixedClock timestamp snapping, the constant-velocity
    lead solver (modules/lead-solver) and the retained-frame gate
    (modules/frame-gate).
  - AFTER-ZERO: the idea of a separate world clock for slow motion with a
    draining/refilling meter.
  - OPT: optimisation patterns applied - invariant-driven reuse (static level
    mesh uploaded once, glass mesh rebuilt only when a pane breaks, cached flow
    field), bounded pools and caps for particles, shards, rings and corpses.
